OL,3,GNEWSACampaign for traffic lights at
OL,4,Abridge thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign for traffic lights at a
OL,7,Fbridge in Coventry has been rejected.
OL,9,FNearly 150 people signed a petition
OL,10,Fcalling for lights at the St James Lane
OL,11,Fbridge in Willenhall "to prevent
OL,12,Fcollisions... due to limited visibility
OL,13,Fwhen approaching and driving" across
OL,14,Fit.
OL,16,FBut lights could cause congestion and
OL,17,Fhave no measurable impact on road
OL,18,Fsafety, the city council said.
